### Configure Joi library options in validationOptions

Source: https://github.com/nestjs/docs.nestjs.com/blob/master/content/migration.md

Place Joi-specific settings under `validationOptions.libraryOptions` when upgrading Joi to v18+. By default, `@nestjs/config` merges user settings with `allowUnknown: true` and `abortEarly: false`.

```typescript
// Before
validationOptions: {
  allowUnknown: false,
  abortEarly: true,
},

// After
validationOptions: {
  libraryOptions: {
    allowUnknown: false,
    abortEarly: true,
  },
},
```

